    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d137">

                <pb facs="0263" n="151" sameAs="frus:frus1918/pg151"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.51/2034</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">MacMurray</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 2205</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Peking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-08-21">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 21, 1918</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to the despatch (No. 1661) of
                    October 9 last,<anchor n="2" xml:id="d137-f1"/> with which the Legation
                    forwarded to the Department a translation of an agreement between the Yokohama
                    Specie Bank and the Chinese Government, concluded August 28, 1917, for an
                    advance of yen 10,000,000 upon the proposed supplementary reorganization loan, I
                    have the honor to enclose herewith a translation (from the Chinese text) of an
                    agreement between the same parties, concluded on July 19 last, for the renewal
                    of the Chinese Government Treasury bills, under the provisions of Article 9 of
                    the earlier agreement.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">J. V. A. MacMurray</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d137-a1.xml" xpointer="d137-a1"/>
            </div>
